// Curated common Chinese occupations (informed by GB/T 6565 国家职业分类).
// Not exhaustive — the 师/员/工/家/匠 suffix heuristic + this lexicon.
// DO NOT treat as a coverage guarantee.
//
// Productive suffixes (师/员/工/家/匠/经理/教练/主播/医生/护士 …) are handled in
// code, NOT enumerated here — this list is the high-confidence head plus the
// multi-char specifics that the suffix heuristic alone would miss or that need
// to score without a cue.
